 Command line input:
 $ crest /home/fellingerc95/Documents/autopocket2crest/tests/testsystem/2ojg/test_pocket_extended_h_fixed.pdb -gfnff -chrg 2 -gbsa h2o -squick --temp 310 --legacy -cinp constraints.inp

  --gfnff : Use of GFN-FF requested.
  -chrg 2
  --gbsa h2o : implicit solvation
  -squick  : very crude quick-mode (no NORMMD, no GC, crude opt.)
  --cinp : constraints.inp

